{
  "Package": "rhdf5client",
  "Title": "Access HDF5 content from HDF Scalable Data Service",
  "Description": "This package provides functionality for reading data from\nHDF Scalable Data Service from within R.  The HSDSArray\nfunction bridges from HSDS to the user via the DelayedArray\ninterface.  Bioconductor manages an open HSDS instance\ngraciously provided by John Readey of the HDF Group.",
